  "intro": {
    "title": "Ein rotes Auto",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Colours are adjectives, so before a noun they take endings: ein rotes Auto, der blaue Himmel. After sein they don't: Das Auto ist rot.",
      "Lila, rosa and orange usually take no endings at all: ein lila Pullover. 'What colour is it?' is Welche Farbe hat das?"
    ]
  },
